  "residual": "The claims verify that Dean Dodrill says his gaming/workstation PC has 5 TB of storage and a wireless keyboard, and that Dean Dodrill describes himself as the creator of Dust: An Elysian Tail. However, they do not establish that Dean Dodrill is the person behind Game B’s intro and end animations, nor that this 5 TB storage figure applies as of 25 July 2013. Thus the requested storage size as of that date is not entailed."
}

